                <pb facs="0764" n="654" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg654"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ryan to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-08-26"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 26,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Ryan reports to Mr. Blaine that he has communicated the instruction of the
                    25th to Mr. Mizner respecting concurrent action and has also given Mr. Azpiroz a
                    copy of Mr. Blaine’s instruction.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
